{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09692","headline":"太白胡僧歌 · 岑参","name":"太白胡僧歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻有胡僧在太白，兰若去天三百尺。\n一持楞伽入中峰，世人难见但闻钟。\n牕边锡杖解两虎，牀下鉢盂藏一龙。\n草衣不鍼复不线，两耳垂肩眉覆面。\n此僧年几那得知，手种青松今十围。\n心将流水同清净，身与浮云无是非。\n商山老人已曾识，愿一见之何由得。\n山中有僧人不知，城里看山空黛色。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}